  turnTime: 18
  turnLine: 'Kessler: Everything I did, I did for you. For you and your brother.
    To make us RICH.|Kessler: YOU SHOULD BE THANKING ME!'
  keyLine: He said it out loud-- and the city's TAKING him.|Something fell out of
    his coat. Keys. The SILO key.|Grab it and GO, before he's finished turning!
  afterTurnLine: Too slow-- he's TURNED. The silo door. NOW!
